cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite Armillary, cite the exact public commit you used, so the calculation boundary you refer to stays identifiable. 引用時請註明所用的公開 commit。"
type: software
title: "渾儀 Armillary"
abstract: "A Traditional-Chinese-first, verifiable calculator for classical Western astrology. It computes charts with Swiss Ephemeris and returns the coordinate frame, time conversion, named methods and their sources, version identities and a step-by-step calculation trace with each result. It calculates only: no interpretation, no prediction."
authors:
  - name: "渾儀 Armillary"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sa3952/Armillary"
url: "https://projectarmillary.com/zh-TW/"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - astrology
  - classical astrology
  - Swiss Ephemeris
  - ephemeris
  - reproducibility
  - Traditional Chinese
